                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>This hazard appears as a Small starship on the sensor map and can be targeted with Hack Comms. Sensor Scream <span class=\"action-glyph\">R</span> (auditory, emotion, fear, mental, sonic)</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A starship targets the hazard with Hack Comms</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> A cursed recording plays on every tech device inside the triggering starship. All creatures that can hear it must attempt a @Check[will|dc:18] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[3d8[mental]] damage and is frightened 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes @Damage[6d8[mental]] damage and is @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2}.</p>"
                },
